<gpx version="1.1" creator="book_route.py" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
<metadata><name>Surveyor Trail (Highway 35 by Road 44 to Clinger Spring, Surveyor Trail to Brooks Meadow)</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:213-3: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="45.373973" lon="-121.566853"><ele>1008.3</ele><name>Highway 35 at Road 44</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:hwy35-road-44 (OSM node 33436785); confidence: high; pdf_page: 214; book_elev_ft: 3280; quote: All tours in this area are reached by skiing (or driving) uphill on Road 44 from Highway 35 ... (3,280 feet)</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.408596" lon="-121.549443"><ele>1294.2</ele><name>Clinger Spring: Road 44 at the Road 620 junction</name><desc>source: OSM node 33433491 (NF 44 / NF 620); OSM Clinger Spring node 45.408783,-121.550818 is 110 m west; Surveyor's Ridge Trail #688 passes 30 m north; confidence: high; pdf_page: 215; book_elev_ft: 4200; quote: The eastward section of the old road starts at Clinger Spring just a few yards from Road 44</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.414473" lon="-121.526400"><ele>1296.0</ele><name>Surveyor Trail meets the Aqueduct Road, 200 yd south of the 44/1720 junction</name><desc>source: OSM node 4274767221, north end of #688 way 945297130 past Cooks Meadow (way 592270313 ends at 45.41228,-121.52702, 450 m south of Brooks Meadow), start of path 'The Hub'; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 215; quote: crosses Cooks Meadow just 500 yards south of Brooks Meadow. Near Brooks Meadow the trail intersects with another primitive, obscure road, the Aqueduct Road</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.416224" lon="-121.525894"><ele>1302.4</ele><name>Road 44 / Road 17 junction (the book's 44/1720 junction), south end of Brooks Meadow</name><desc>source: OSM node 33437099, where 215-1 ends; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 217; book_elev_ft: 4280; quote: ski the more interesting Surveyor Trail to the Road 44/1720 junction. Enter the trees straight ahead to locate nearby Brooks Meadow.</desc></wpt>
<trk><name>Surveyor Trail (Highway 35 by Road 44 to Clinger Spring, Surveyor Trail to Brooks Meadow)</name><desc>1. Highway 35 at Road 44 -&gt; Clinger Spring: Road 44 at the Road 620 junction: osm (high), 3.65 mi | 2. Clinger Spring: Road 44 at the Road 620 junction -&gt; Surveyor Trail meets the Aqueduct Road, 200 yd south of the 44/1720 junction: osm (high), 1.60 mi | 3. Surveyor Trail meets the Aqueduct Road, 200 yd south of the 44/1720 junction -&gt; Road 44 / Road 17 junction (the book's 44/1720 junction), south end of Brooks Meadow: osm (medium), 0.15 mi</desc>
